      "line" : 27,
      "npc" : "Bulletin Board",
      "text" : "[Alberta: The Port City]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 28,
      "npc" : "Bulletin Board",
      "text" : "In Alberta, you can find the Merchant guild where adventurers can change their job to merchant"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 30,
      "npc" : "Bulletin Board",
      "text" : "[Alberta: The Port City]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 31,
      "npc" : "Bulletin Board",
      "text" : "As a city that provides dependable sea travel, Alberta has provided the means for the foreign commerce that has brought prosperity to the Rune-Midgarts Kingdom."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 33,
      "npc" : "Bulletin Board",
      "text" : "[Alberta: The Port City]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 34,
      "npc" : "Bulletin Board",
      "text" : "On the docks, you may find representatives from foreign lands that will guide tourists to their countries."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 36,
      "npc" : "Bulletin Board",
      "text" : "[Alberta: The Port City]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 37,
      "npc" : "Bulletin Board",
      "text" : "Among seafarers, there is a rumor of a place known as ^338C60Turtle Island^000000. Intrepid adventurers may seek to investigate this rumor and learn the truth for themselves"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 39,
      "npc" : "Bulletin Board",
      "text" : "[Alberta: The Port City]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 40,
      "npc" : "Bulletin Board",
      "text" : "There is also a sunken ship that has been discovered near Alberta, and it has become a popular area for adventurers to explore"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 42,
      "npc" : "Bulletin Board",
      "text" : "[Alberta: The Port City]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 43,
      "npc" : "Bulletin Board",
      "text" : "From Alberta, ^1F3A11Payon^000000 is located to the Northwest. You can board passenger ships at the dock to travel to ^5E5C69Izlude^000000."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 44,
      "npc" : "Bulletin Board",
      "text" : "Enjoy your travels."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 49,
      "npc" : "Bulletin Board",
      "text" : "[Geffen: The City of Magic]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 50,
      "npc" : "Bulletin Board",
      "text" : "Welcome to Geffen, the City of Magic. Geffen is well known for its various legends related to magic."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 52,
      "npc" : "Bulletin Board",
      "text" : "[Geffen: The City of Magic]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 53,
      "npc" : "Bulletin Board",
      "text" : "Points of interest in the city include the Forge, where people can change their jobs to Blacksmith, the Magic Academy for aspiring mages, and the Geffen Tower for the Wizard job change."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 55,
      "npc" : "Bulletin Board",
      "text" : "[Geffen: The City of Magic]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 56,
      "npc" : "Bulletin Board",
      "text" : "Underneath the Geffen Tower lies a dungeon in which dreadful monsters are rumored to appear."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 58,
      "npc" : "Bulletin Board",
      "text" : "[Geffen: The City of Magic]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 59,
      "npc" : "Bulletin Board",
      "text" : "It is said that the lost city of Gefenia, a place of elven lore and legend, is hidden within the depths of this dungeon."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 61,
      "npc" : "Bulletin Board",
      "text" : "[Geffen: The City of Magic]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 62,
      "npc" : "Bulletin Board",
      "text" : "From Geffen, the ^828E28Orc Village^000000 is located to the South, ^4C6055Glast Heim^000000 to the West, ^6D6FE0Prontera^000000 to the far East, and ^744B2DMt. Mjolnir^000000 to the North. Enjoy your stay here in Geffen."
    },
    {
