      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 84,
      "npc" : "Bulletin Board",
      "text" : "Payon is famous for being a city of archery. For a long time, its citizens have made their living by hunting with bows and arrows. Bow crafting and training have also been developed here in Payon"
